# ── bass ──
# The figure: three sixteenths between kicks, the middle one leaning.

# Shut: the roll under a closed filter, only the pluck of each note gets through;
# the eighth bar steps to the b2
pattern roll_shut {
    - 1.1:0.7(cutoff=0.2) 1.1:0.95 1.1:0.75  - 1.1:0.7 1.1:0.95 1.1:0.75  - 1.1:0.7 1.1:0.95 1.1:0.75  - 1.1:0.7 1.1:0.95 1.1:0.75
